# and the CS Wildcat Badge, AssaultPromotion 25, three Imperial Gold Pieces, ten Imperial Mythril Pieces, a Troll
# Pauldron, a Bone Chip. Abquhbah (his script: 255; no onTrade of his own) stands in trigger area 3 (31 -7 -60 .. 39 -6
# -52), whose handler also answers 5071 while the quest is available: the talks here stand south-east of the area (x
# 39.5, z -62), so his own 5071 shows; `#edges` shows the area's. Available: Abquhbah 5071: begun. Prog 0: 5072 (once
# per zone); again: 255; two Gold Pieces: not exactly three: nil: nothing; three: 5073: taken, Prog 1, the Officer
# Academy Manual. Prog 1: Abquhbah, local Prog 0: 5074 (local 1); again: nil: 255; two Mythril Pieces: 5075, option 2
# (not 1): taken, local 0, still Prog 1: 5074 again; 5075, option 1: Prog 2. Prog 2: 5074; Nashmau and back (a zone-in
# drops the local var): 5074 again; two Mythril Pieces: 5076: Prog 3. Prog 3: 5079 (once per zone); again: 255; the Bone
# Chip: no beastmen item: nil; the Troll Pauldron alone: 5077: taken, local 0, Prog 4. Prog 4: 5074; two Mythril Pieces:
# 5078, option 2: taken, local 0, not completed: 5074; again, option 1: completed (the SL Wildcat Badge, Second
# Lieutenant), AssaultPromotion 0, the CS badge taken, SECOND_LIEUTENANT (user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs: the
# Lua dropped it).
